 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "He was despised and rejected by men",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.96,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A man of sorrows, acquainted with grief",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And as one from whom men hide their faces",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He was despised, and we esteemed him not",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Surely he has borne our griefs",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And carried our sorrows",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He was pierced for our transgressions",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He was crushed for our iniquities",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Upon him was the chastisement that brought us peace",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And by his wounds we are healed",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Surely he has borne our griefs",
